repository-code: https://github.com/LebedevIV/monostring-hypothesis
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Twenty-three computational experiments across
  seven mathematical frameworks testing the
  monostring (single protoelement) hypothesis.
  Zero confirmed physical signals. One live
  prediction: w(z)≠-1 consistent with DESI 2024.
  Nine mathematical theorems discovered during
  falsification. Fourteen artifacts documented.
  Part XXIII adds dynamical string fission via
  DNLS modulational instability and sine-Gordon
  topological solitons.
keywords:
  - monostring
  - quantum gravity
  - emergent spacetime
  - sine-Gordon
  - topological solitons
  - falsification
  - DESI
  - dark energy
